21537#issuecomment-5012975185","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121537","id":5012975185,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABKsvuUQ","user":{"login":"NoNormalDev","id":190293561,"node_id":"U_kgDOC1emOQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190293561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev","html_url":"https://github.com/NoNormalDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-18T21:22:38Z","updated_at":"2026-07-18T21:22:38Z","body":"> `The multiplication is performed on linearly encoded color values.`\r\n\r\nIn my opinion it's more confusing than helpful.\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5012975185/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5014695870","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121537#issuecomment-5014695870","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121537","id":5014695870,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABKuYvvg","user":{"login":"BrianGixxob","id":229223789,"node_id":"U_kgDODamtbQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/229223789?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrianGixxob","html_url":"https://github.com/BrianGixxob","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrianGixxob/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrianGixxob/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrianGixxob/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrianGixxob/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrianGixxob/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrianGixxob/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrianGixxob/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrianGixxob/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrianGixxob/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-19T06:25:12Z","updated_at":"2026-07-19T06:25:12Z","body":"1. Hobbyist viewpoint: the original \"The color applied to ...\" is intuitive (less jargon).\r\n\r\n2. Could add detail to original: \"The color applied to this [CanvasItem] (using multiplication).\"\r\n\r\n3. Active voice suggestions:\r\n\r\n- **Original**: \"Apply this color to the [CanvasItem].\"\r\n- **Original with detail**: \"Apply this color to the [CanvasItem] (using multiplication).\"\r\n- **PR**: \"Multiply the [CanvasItem]'s pixels by this color.\"","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5014695870/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5015321603","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121537#issuecomment-5015321603","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121537","id":5015321603,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABKu-8Aw","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-19T10:10:57Z","updated_at":"2026-07-19T10:12:05Z","body":"\"_The color by which each pixel in this [CanvasItem] is multiplied_\" is oddly verbose and features a notorious sentence structure (\"by which\"). You tend to find it mostly in academic writing and it makes this sentence harder to parse, just to hint that multiplication is involved in the process.\r\n\r\nTo be frank I don't even think this PR is _particularly_ necessary, and so far none of the wording convince me at all. The effect is very evident upon modifying the properties themselves, and the original issue's creator seems to be a one-off case, with more contributors wondering whether it's necessary rather than users claiming it is.\r\nDespite this, I do still [sympathise with the need to express this more explicitly](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117992#issuecomment-4188885168). But by that logic it should be done basically everywhere, because \"**modulation**\" is how colors are \"applied\" for a lot of properties, methods, theme items, and so on. You can even argue that, because it's the norm (the default), it doesn't need to be explicitly said.\r\nLess is more. I could spend hours talking about details, but that's the gist.\r\n\r\nAnd I don't think it's a good idea to describe it _everywhere_ in the way this PR does, as of writing this.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5015321603/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5015879567","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121537#issuecomment-5015879567","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121537","id":5015879567,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABKvg_jw","user":{"login":"PavielKraskouski","id":9061796,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwNjE3OTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9061796?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PavielKraskouski","html_url":"https://github.com/PavielKraskouski","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PavielKraskouski/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PavielKraskouski/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PavielKraskouski/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PavielKraskouski/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PavielKraskouski/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PavielKraskouski/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PavielKraskouski/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PavielKraskouski/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PavielKraskouski/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-19T13:22:48Z","updated_at":"2026-07-19T13:22:48Z","body":"Сould add a little clarification at the end of the sentence, as @BrianGixxob suggested:\r\n`The color applied to this [CanvasItem] via multiplication.`","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5015879567/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5023196959","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121537#issuecomment-5023196959","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121537","id":5023196959,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABK2fnHw","user":{"login":"ramblingstranger","id":114190975,"node_id":"U_kgDOBs5qfw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/114190975?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramblingstranger","html_url":"https://github.com/ramblingstranger","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramblingstranger/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramblingstranger/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramblingstranger/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramblingstranger/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramblingstranger/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramblingstranger/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramblingstranger/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramblingstranger/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramblingstranger/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-20T14:10:28Z","updated_at":"2026-07-20T20:02:59Z","body":"@Mickeon Let me know the direction you want to move in. I'm happy to implement any or to close the PR. Just looking to start contributing to Godot. :)\r\n\r\nFor context, I had considered something like, `The color applied to this [CanvasItem] via multiplication.` I decided against it because I felt it was not very explicit about *how* multiplication was used. I think the current formulation is pretty clear (apart from the \"by which...\" structure), and I'm not sure how to make it more clear besides breaking it into two sentences.\r\n\r\nThat said, it definitely could be broken up into two sentences, and that would allow us to get rid of the \"by which...\" structure. Maybe something like, `The color applied to this [CanvasItem]. Each pixel is multiplied by this color.` I think if we went with this approach, it could also make sense to only change the docs for the `modulate` property, and leave the `self_modulate` property as it was prior to this PR.\r\n\r\nIf you want to clarify that this is extra information, and help readers gloss over it if they are just looking for the basic info about `modulate`, you could make it a parenthetical sentence: `The color applied to this [CanvasItem]. (Each pixel is multiplied by this color.)`\r\n\r\nAnyway, as I said before, I'm just trying to learn about how the contribution process works for Godot. Happy to move in any direction with this, including closing the PR.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5023196959/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]